# Build context of the server image is the folder above LisekMovie-app
# (it also holds the provider plugins). Send only what the build needs:
# everything else there (other projects, private notes, FFmpeg downloads,
# media) never leaves the machine.
*
!LisekMovie-app/LisekMovie-Backend
!LisekMovie-plugin-*
**/target
LisekMovie-plugin-*/Cargo.lock
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/config/metadata
LisekMovie-app/LisekMovie-Backend/Dockerfile*
